        "write a rust function named parse_line"
      ]
    },
    "fr": {
      "Title": "Code",
      "Summary": "Générer des fonctions, scripts, classes, modules et tests en PowerShell, Python, JavaScript, C#, Rust ou Bash.",
      "Examples": [
        "genere une fonction nommee Get-Report",
        "ecris un script",
        "ecris une classe python nommee \"Facture\""
      ]
    }
  },
  "Rewrites": [
    {
      "Pattern": "(?i)(?<![\\w#])c\\s?#(?![\\w#])|\\bc[- ]sharp\\b",
      "Replacement": "csharp"
    },
    {
      "Pattern": "(?i)\\bnode\\.js\\b",
      "Replacement": "node"
    }
  ]
